      "summary": "The EU sanctions against Chen Zhi and the Prince Group entered into force upon their publication on July 30 of this year. This means that tobacco retailers trading with Elite Trading Scandinavia or The Premium Company Nordic—or even paying an invoice today for a delivery that occurred prior to July 30—may already be committing a sanctions violation. Not even the end consumer is spared: if you purchase a box of Cubans at retail for personal use, you risk having your bank account closed and being punished for breaching sanctions.",
